#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:94
msgid ""
"A powerful and user-friendly app available on both iOS and Android. It has a"
" great 'Photo Mode' for creating high-quality models."
msgstr "一款功能强大且用户友好的应用程序，可在 iOS 和 Android 上使用。它具有出色的“照片模式”，可用于创建高质量模型。"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:95
msgid ""
"Excellent for iPhone and iPad users with a LiDAR sensor, but also works well"
" on other devices."
msgstr "非常适合配备 LiDAR 传感器的 iPhone 和 iPad 用户，而且在其他设备上也能正常工作。"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:96
msgid ""
"Another great cross-platform option that processes the photos in the cloud."
msgstr "另一个很棒的跨平台选项，可以在云中处理照片。"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:98
msgid ""
"Download one of these apps from your device's app store to get started."
msgstr "从设备的应用程序商店下载这些应用程序之一即可开始使用。"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:102
msgid "Step 2: Prepare Your Product and Space"
msgstr "第 2 步：准备您的产品和空间"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:103
msgid "Good preparation is key to a successful scan."
msgstr "良好的准备是成功扫描的关键。"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:105
msgid ""
"Use bright, even, and diffuse lighting. Avoid harsh shadows and direct "
"sunlight. An overcast day outdoors or a well-lit room is ideal."
msgstr "使用明亮、均匀且漫射的照明。避免强烈的阴影和阳光直射。阴天的户外或光线充足的房间是理想的选择。"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:106
msgid ""
"Place your product on a non-reflective, textured surface. A newspaper or a "
"textured mat works well. Avoid plain white or glossy surfaces."
msgstr "将您的产品放在不反光、有纹理的表面上。报纸或有纹理的垫子效果很好。避免纯白色或有光泽的表面。"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:107
msgid "Ensure you have enough space to walk all the way around your product."
msgstr "确保您有足够的空间在产品周围行走。"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:109
msgid "A product set up in a well-lit area for 3D scanning"
msgstr "将产品放置在光线充足的区域进行 3D 扫描"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:113
msgid "Step 3: Capture the Photos"
msgstr "第三步：拍摄照片"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:114
msgid ""
"Open your chosen 3D scanning app and start a new scan using the photo or "
"photogrammetry mode."
msgstr "打开您选择的 3D 扫描应用程序，然后使用照片或摄影测量模式开始新的扫描。"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:116
msgid ""
"Take photos in a full circle around your product at one height (e.g., eye-"
"level)."
msgstr "在一个高度（例如，与眼睛水平）围绕产品拍摄一整圈照片。"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:116
#, python-format
msgid "Overlap each photo by about 60-70%%."
msgstr "每张照片重叠约 60-70%%。"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:116
msgid "Most apps will show you guides."
msgstr "大多数应用程序都会向您显示指南。"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:117
msgid ""
"Take another full circle of photos from a higher angle, looking down at the "
"product."
msgstr "从更高的角度再拍摄一整圈照片，俯视产品。"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:118
msgid "If possible, take a third circle from a lower angle, looking up."
msgstr "如果可能的话，从较低的角度向上看第三圈。"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:119
msgid "Capture the top and any intricate details separately."
msgstr "分别捕捉顶部和任何复杂的细节。"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:121
msgid ""
"You should aim for at least 40-70 high-quality, sharp photos for a good "
"result. More is often better!"
msgstr "为了获得良好的效果，您应该拍摄至少 40-70 张高质量、清晰的照片。更多往往更好！"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:125
msgid "Step 4: Process and Export"
msgstr "第 4 步：处理和导出"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:126
msgid ""
"Once you've taken all your photos, tell the app to process them. This may "
"take a few minutes as it uploads the images and builds the model in the "
"cloud."
msgstr "拍摄完所有照片后，请让应用程序处理它们。这可能需要几分钟的时间，因为它会上传图像并在云中构建模型。"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:127
msgid ""
"After processing is complete, inspect the 3D model in the app. If it looks "
"good, find the 'Export' or 'Share' option."
msgstr "处理完成后，在应用程序中检查 3D 模型。如果看起来不错，请找到“导出”或“共享”选项。"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:129
msgid "Choose the format:"
msgstr "选择格式："

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:129
msgid "GLB is usually the best choice as it's a single, compact file."
msgstr "GLB 通常是最佳选择，因为它是一个紧凑的文件。"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:130
msgid ""
"Choose a texture resolution. 'Medium' or 'High' (e.g., 2K or 2048x2048) is "
"usually a good balance of quality and file size."
msgstr "选择纹理分辨率。 “中”或“高”（例如 2K 或 2048x2048）通常可以很好地平衡质量和文件大小。"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:131
msgid ""
"Save the exported .glb file to your device, cloud storage, or email it to "
"yourself."
msgstr "将导出的 .glb 文件保存到您的设备、云存储或通过电子邮件发送给自己。"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:136
msgid "Step 5: Upload to NEXUS"
msgstr "第5步：上传至NEXUS"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:137
msgid ""
"You're at the final step! Navigate back to the product creation or editing "
"page on NEXUS."
msgstr "你已经到了最后一步了！导航回 NEXUS 上的产品创建或编辑页面。"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:139
msgid "Find the '3D Model' field."
msgstr "找到“3D 模型”字段。"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:140
msgid ""
"Click 'Choose File' and select the .glb or .gltf file you just exported."
msgstr "单击“选择文件”并选择刚刚导出的 .glb 或 .gltf 文件。"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:141
msgid ""
"Save your product. Your new 3D model will now be available on the product "
"detail page!"
msgstr "保存您的产品。您的新 3D 模型现在将出现在产品详细信息页面上！"

#: .\templates\core\help\creating_3d_models.html:146
msgid "Back to My Products"
msgstr "返回我的产品"

