msgstr "生成恢复代码"

#: .\templates\mfa\recovery_codes\generate.html:11
msgid ""
"You are about to generate a new set of recovery codes. If you have any "
"existing, unused codes, they will be invalidated."
msgstr "您将生成一组新的恢复代码。如果您有任何现有的、未使用的代码，它们将失效。"

#: .\templates\mfa\recovery_codes\generate.html:13
#, python-format
msgid "You currently have %(count)s unused recovery code(s)."
msgstr "您当前有 %(count)s 个未使用的恢复代码。"

#: .\templates\mfa\recovery_codes\index.html:4
#: .\templates\mfa\recovery_codes\index.html:7
msgid "Your Recovery Codes"
msgstr "您的恢复代码"

#: .\templates\mfa\recovery_codes\index.html:12
msgid "Important:"
msgstr "重要的："

#: .\templates\mfa\recovery_codes\index.html:12
msgid ""
"Store these codes in a safe place, like a password manager. Each code can "
"only be used once."
msgstr "将这些代码存储在安全的地方，例如密码管理器。每个代码只能使用一次。"

#: .\templates\mfa\recovery_codes\index.html:23
#, python-format
msgid "You have %(unused)s of %(total)s recovery codes remaining."
msgstr "You have %(unused)s of %(total)s recovery codes remaining."

#: .\templates\mfa\recovery_codes\index.html:26
msgid "Download Codes"
msgstr "下载代码"

